<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Cells.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":":= try' \\* t. (x : option' t) : t =\n    !\\\\(x, $'\"$0?\"')\n\n:= map' \\* t u. (fn : t -> u) (x : option' t) : option' u =\n    (!\\\\(x, $'\"true; let _optionm_map_ = $0.map(|x| { //\"') : bool) |> ignore\n    := result = fn !\\($'\"x\"')\n    (!\\\\(result, $'\"true; $0 })\"') : bool) |> ignore\n    !\\($'\"_optionm_map_\"')\n\n:= unwrap \\* t. (x : option' t) : t =\n    !\\\\(x, $'\"$0.unwrap()\"')\n\n:= take \\* t. (x : option' t) : option' t =\n    (!\\\\(x, $'\"true; let mut !x = !x\"') : bool) |> ignore\n    !\\\\(x, $'\"Option::take(&mut $0)\"')\n\n:= take_ref \\* t. (x : rust::ref (option' t)) : option' t =\n    (!\\\\(x, $'\"true; let mut !x = !x\"') : bool) |> ignore\n    !\\\\(x, $'\"Option::take(&mut $0)\"')\n\n:= take_ref_mut \\* t. (x : rust::ref (rust::mut' (option' t))) : option' t =\n    !\\\\(x, $'\"Option::take($0)\"')\n\n:= cloned \\* t. (x : option' (rust::ref t)) : option' t =\n    !\\\\(x, $'\"$0.cloned()\"')\n\n:= as_ref \\* t. (x : rust::ref (option' t)) : option' (rust::ref t) =\n    !\\\\(x, $'\"$0.as_ref()\"')\n\n:= as_mut \\* t. (x : rust::ref (rust::mut' (option' t))) : option' (rust::ref (rust::mut' t)) =\n    !\\\\(x, $'\"$0.as_mut()\"')\n\n:= unwrap_or \\* t. (def : t) (x : option' t) : t =\n    !\\($'\"!x.unwrap_or(!def)\"')\n\n:= and_then \\* t u. (fn : t -> option' u) (x : option' t) : option' u =\n    !\\\\((x, fn), $'\"$0.and_then(|x| $1(x))\"')\n\n:= rc_upgrade \\* t. (x : rust::weak_rc t) : option' (rust::rc t) =\n    !\\\\(x, $'\"std::rc::Weak::upgrade(&$0)\"')\n\n:= rc_into_inner \\* t. (x : rust::rc t) : option' t =\n    !\\\\(x, $'\"std::rc::Rc::into_inner($0)\"')","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Cells.eval!(
  ~S"""
  := try' \* t. (x : option' t) : t =
      !\\(x, $'"$0?"')

  := map' \* t u. (fn : t -> u) (x : option' t) : option' u =
      (!\\(x, $'"true; let _optionm_map_ = $0.map(|x| { //"') : bool) |> ignore
      := result = fn !\($'"x"')
      (!\\(result, $'"true; $0 })"') : bool) |> ignore
      !\($'"_optionm_map_"')

  := unwrap \* t. (x : option' t) : t =
      !\\(x, $'"$0.unwrap()"')

  := take \* t. (x : option' t) : option' t =
      (!\\(x, $'"true; let mut !x = !x"') : bool) |> ignore
      !\\(x, $'"Option::take(&mut $0)"')

  := take_ref \* t. (x : rust::ref (option' t)) : option' t =
      (!\\(x, $'"true; let mut !x = !x"') : bool) |> ignore
      !\\(x, $'"Option::take(&mut $0)"')

  := take_ref_mut \* t. (x : rust::ref (rust::mut' (option' t))) : option' t =
      !\\(x, $'"Option::take($0)"')

  := cloned \* t. (x : option' (rust::ref t)) : option' t =
      !\\(x, $'"$0.cloned()"')

  := as_ref \* t. (x : rust::ref (option' t)) : option' (rust::ref t) =
      !\\(x, $'"$0.as_ref()"')

  := as_mut \* t. (x : rust::ref (rust::mut' (option' t))) : option' (rust::ref (rust::mut' t)) =
      !\\(x, $'"$0.as_mut()"')

  := unwrap_or \* t. (def : t) (x : option' t) : t =
      !\($'"!x.unwrap_or(!def)"')

  := and_then \* t u. (fn : t -> option' u) (x : option' t) : option' u =
      !\\((x, fn), $'"$0.and_then(|x| $1(x))"')

  := rc_upgrade \* t. (x : rust::weak_rc t) : option' (rust::rc t) =
      !\\(x, $'"std::rc::Weak::upgrade(&$0)"')

  := rc_into_inner \* t. (x : rust::rc t) : option' t =
      !\\(x, $'"std::rc::Rc::into_inner($0)"')
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

#### rc_into_inner (test)

